OL,3,GNEWSAFormer uni site's #640m revamp
OL,4,Aplan gets go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #640m regeneration scheme to
OL,7,F"transform" a former university site
OL,8,Fand deliver more than 1,500 homes has
OL,9,Fbeen approved.
OL,11,FHomes England, the government's housing
OL,12,Fand regeneration agency, brought the
OL,13,Fformer Thames Valley University site in
OL,14,FSlough in 2023.
OL,16,FIts head of development, Ian Knight,
OL,17,Ftold Slough councillors who approved
OL,18,Fthe project on Wednesday that it is
OL,19,Fplanning "transformational change" for
OL,20,Fthe town centre.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
