OL,3,GNEWSAFormer uni site's #640m revamp
OL,4,Aplan gets go-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development, known as the North
OL,7,FWest Quadrant, is the latest major
OL,8,Fproject for housing in Slough town
OL,9,Fcentre, following plans to use the
OL,10,FQueensmere Shopping Centre for 1,600
OL,11,Fhomes.
